      },
      "description": "Spanish Mercantile Registry sheet number, \"Hoja M-123456\", \"H AB 23576\": identifies the company (Docudis addition) (Docudis change 2026-09-21: \"hoja\" is lowercase in running prose, which is where it actually appears: \"folio 1, hoja A-156980\".)",
      "examples": [
        "Hoja M-123456",
        "H AB 23576",
        "H B 558948"
      ]
    },
    {
